o ally build claim is consulted.|al_dist:condition 3 ‚Äî we must be MORE than DEFEND_ALARM_MIN_DIST (9) tiles from the pill. We are 7.2. Inside that radius there is nothing left to travel to, so the alarm drops and the goal with it.|al_wd:condition 4 ‚Äî the pill must not already be HELD. Allies within DEFEND_WELL_DEFENDED_RADIUS (10 tiles) of it ‚Äî visible allied tanks, or allies whose broadcast goal is a defend_pill/repair_pill response aimed here, whichever count is larger, this bot excluded ‚Äî versus enemy tanks in the same radius. R = ceil(their_team/our_team) rounds the coverage requirement in the defenders' favour, so it is held when foes <= allies x R (and no visible foes plus any ally is held). Here: foes 0, allies 1, R 1 -> HELD, so no alarm is raised and the evaluator moves on to the next pill.|state:pill hp=15/15, hits taken 0; watch=not watchedcostÍå†9Y>)Freject_remainingmyÇmxêrejectalarm_off:no_enemy_nearidtier	alarm_offstale\formulaŒREJECT alarm_off:no_enemy_near al_enemy{none in 11t} al_trig{none dmg0 bldN} al_dist{19.4>9} al_wd{0/1x1 HELD}||al_base:DEFEND_ALARM_BASE_COST ‚Äî the flat price of an alarmed defend trip, before the damage discount|al_hits:0 enemy-attributed hit(s) on this pill inside the last 250 ticks (5 s), from perception's per-pill ring: hits classified `tank` (hostile tank fire) or `epill` (hostile pillbox stray). A `npill` stray is a NEUTRAL pillbox and is not counted.|al_disc:DEFEND_ALARM_HIT_DISCOUNT ‚Äî subtracted once per counted hit: 100 - 0 x 10 = 0|al_net:base - hits x discount, before the floor|al_floor:DEFEND_ALARM_MIN_COST ‚Äî the discount can never take the trip below this. Not binding here (the raw net is at or above it).|al_dij:-|al_enemy:condition 1 ‚Äî a hostile tank the engine is showing us THIS TICK within 11 euclidean tiles of the pill. Not a remembered sighting and not a ghost. Nothing hostile is visible in the ring, so the alarm is OFF.|al_trig:condition 2 ‚Äî (a) an